{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111567","id":2908412467,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tWtoz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111567","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111567.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111567.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111567","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111567/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111567/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111567/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6c9ce7c5867f221042cbc91cb4aa9dac8b742e32","number":111567,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: replace `class_db.h` include with `object.h` include in `ref_counted.h`","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Part of #111218 \r\n\r\nReplaces the `class_db.h` include in `ref_counted.h` with an `object.h` include. \r\nThis reduces the total number of includes in `ref_counted.h` from 81 to 70.\r\n\r\nAll other changes are cascading and necessary for the project to compile. \r\n\r\nSome stats:\r\n* 42 cascading files changed\r\n* 104 total files include `ref_counted.h` directly, realizing a changed rate of 40.4%\r\n  * caveat: not all files changed include `ref_counted.h`, in some cases the change was either applied to the cpp file only (if not needed in header file) or applied to a file upstream that provides it to several files downstream that needed the same change. This was only done with files primarily (or exclusively) included in files which needed the change. \r\n* 2940 total files include it directly or transitively, realizing a changed rater of 1.4%\r\n* 2804 files now include `class_db.h`, down from 2986, a reduction of 6.16%\r\n* The engine now has a total of 395,957 transitive includes, down from 396,921, a reduction of 0.245%\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: the numbers above may seem fairly small, which I assume is in no unsignificant part due to `resource.h` still including `class_db.h`, and most paths that include `ref_counted.h` also include `resource.h`. I decided on doing `ref_counted.h` first since it is upstream of `resource.h`, so the most significant difference will be in my follow up PR which will fix that issue. \r\n\r\nDisclaimer 2: This PR does not attempt to reduce the number of `ref_counted.h` includes, even though some may not be obsolete as they might have been purely transitive to get to `ref_counted.h`'s includes. This is done in order to keep the changes exclusively related to the direct cascading effects. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6T